---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Design and development services | Jeanine" description="Brand design and fast Astro sites for teams that sell online, from the first sketch to the launch.">
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<main class="wrapper about">
			<section>
				<h1>Design and development services</h1>
				<p class="lede">Design and development for teams that sell online, from the first sketch to the launch.</p>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Design</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>Brand systems and sites that share one set of tokens, the way <a href="https://www.figma.com/">Figma</a> libraries keep a team in sync. The latest is a storefront refresh for a coffee roaster in Oakland.</p>
					<img alt="Sketches for a storefront" height="900" src="/rp-site-astro/assets/stock-1.jpg" width="1600" />
					<h3>Timeline</h3>
					<p>Two to four weeks, with a review every Friday and notes the same day.</p>
					<a class="cta-button" href="/rp-site-astro/work/">See the work</a>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Development</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>
						Fast static sites on <a href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a>, deployed to
						<a href="https://pages.github.com/">GitHub Pages</a> or your own host.
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Content in Markdown your team can edit</li>
						<li>Lighthouse scores above 95</li>
						<li>Analytics without cookies</li>
					</ul>
					<h3>Timeline</h3>
					<p>Four to eight weeks, depending on the content.</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Workshops</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>A half-day session with your team on content models and page structure, based on the <a href="https://docs.astro.build/">Astro docs</a>.</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Support</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>A monthly plan for fixes and small features, billed by the hour.</p>
					<img width="1600" height="900" src="/rp-site-astro/assets/stock-3.jpg" alt="A desk with a laptop" />
					<a class="cta-button" href="mailto:hello@e2e.test">Ask for a quote</a>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<div class="content">
					<p>Read <a href="https://nerai-labs.github.io/rp-site-astro/about/">how I work</a> before we talk.</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Questions</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<h3>Do you work with agencies?</h3>
					<p>Yes, as a white label partner on design and builds.</p>
					<h3>Where is the site hosted?</h3>
					<p>On GitHub Pages or your own host.</p>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
	</div>
	<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
		"@context": "https://schema.org",
		"@type": "ProfessionalService",
		"name": "Jeanine White Design and Development",
		"areaServed": "Worldwide"
	})} />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3.5rem;
	}

	img {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
		max-width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}

	section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--gray-200);
	}

	.section-title {
		grid-column-start: 1;
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	.content {
		grid-column: 2 / 4;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.content :global(a) {
		text-decoration: 1px solid underline;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
	}

	.cta-button {
		align-self: flex-start;
		padding: 0.56em 2em;
		border-radius: 999rem;
		color: var(--accent-text-over);
		background: var(--gradient-accent-orange);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
		text-decoration: none !important;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.about {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
		}

		.about > :global(:first-child) {
			grid-column-start: 2;
		}

		section {
			display: contents;
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}
	}
</style>
